medium_1_e011d79ce2.jpeg","medium_1_e011d79ce2","medium_1.jpeg",97.76,530,{"ext":34,"url":159,"hash":160,"mime":37,"name":161,"path":8,"size":162,"width":163,"height":62},"https:\u002F\u002Fempowerhk.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com\u002Fthumbnail_1_e011d79ce2.jpeg","thumbnail_1_e011d79ce2","thumbnail_1.jpeg",6,110,"1_e011d79ce2",277.48,"https:\u002F\u002Fempowerhk.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com\u002F1_e011d79ce2.jpeg","2025-11-04T09:26:08.141Z",{"id":169,"attributes":170},187,{"start_date":171,"title":172,"content":173,"excerpt":8,"slug":174,"end_date":171,"tags":8,"createdAt":175,"updatedAt":175,"event_categories":176,"image":180},"2024-01-27","龍年篆書揮春及年畫創作坊","\u003Cp\u003E根據中華傳統習俗，農曆新年在家張貼揮春和年畫，可保護家人，並為家庭祈求幸福。\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003EEmpower榮幸邀得兩位藝術大師蒞臨指導 — 「大象老師」結合傳統書法與當代藝術，讓學員極速掌握揮春創作精髓和篆書書法技巧；「太歲老師」指導年畫印製技巧，讓參加者運用拼版模式創作特色作品。\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E日期：1月27日（星期六）\u003Cbr\u003E時間：下午2:30-4:30\u003Cbr\u003E費用：$330\u002F位\u003Cbr\u003E&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; $430\u002F親子2人（5歲以上）\u003Cbr\u003E包2幅年畫、8幅揮春\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;\"\u003E報名：請傳電郵到aksempowerhk@gmail.com 或在 Facebook.com\u002Fempower.hk 給我們Messanger 訊息。謝謝！\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003EPowered by Empower\u003Cbr\u003Ewww.Empower.hk\u003Cbr\u003EFacebook.com\u002FEmpower.hk\u003Cbr\u003EYouTube.com\u002FEmpowerhk\u003C\u002Fp\u003E","fai_chun_2024","2024-01-07T07:42:35.997Z",{"data":177},[178],{"id":14,"attributes":179},{"name":16,"slug":17,"description":8,"createdAt":18,"updatedAt":18},{"data":181},{"id":182,"attributes":183},38,{"name":184,"alternativeText":8,"caption":8,"width":185,"height":186,"formats":187,"hash":200,"ext":34,"mime":37,"siz