":226,"url":268,"hash":269,"mime":37,"name":234,"path":8,"size":235,"width":47,"height":193},"https:\u002F\u002Fempowerhk.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com\u002Fsmall_310970711_5782637858423103_7695343569265848846_n_d0dd0154c1.jpg","small_310970711_5782637858423103_7695343569265848846_n_d0dd0154c1",{"ext":226,"url":271,"hash":272,"mime":37,"name":239,"path":8,"size":240,"width":54,"height":241},"https:\u002F\u002Fempowerhk.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com\u002Fmedium_310970711_5782637858423103_7695343569265848846_n_d0dd0154c1.jpg","medium_310970711_5782637858423103_7695343569265848846_n_d0dd0154c1",{"ext":226,"url":274,"hash":275,"mime":37,"name":245,"path":8,"size":246,"width":199,"height":62},"https:\u002F\u002Fempowerhk.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com\u002Fthumbnail_310970711_5782637858423103_7695343569265848846_n_d0dd0154c1.jpg","thumbnail_310970711_5782637858423103_7695343569265848846_n_d0dd0154c1","310970711_5782637858423103_7695343569265848846_n_d0dd0154c1","https:\u002F\u002Fempowerhk.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com\u002F310970711_5782637858423103_7695343569265848846_n_d0dd0154c1.jpg","2023-07-19T11:22:41.670Z",{"id":280,"attributes":281},182,{"start_date":282,"title":283,"content":284,"excerpt":8,"slug":285,"end_date":282,"tags":8,"createdAt":286,"updatedAt":286,"event_categories":287,"image":291},"2022-10-29","饒宗頤文化館～歷史文化美食深度半天遊","\u003Cp style=\"margin-left:0.0px;\"\u003EEmpower榮幸邀得香港中華文化促進中心理事Jimmy盧志明先生，為我們作星級導賞！\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp style=\"margin-left:0.0px;\"\u003E精彩行程如下：\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp style=\"margin-left:0.0px;\"\u003E💡在下區藝術館看饒宗頤生平(南饒北季)，到保育館了解饒館的前世今生👍🏻\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp style=\"margin-left:0.0px;\"\u003E💡遊覽中區漢字起源&lt; 活字生香&gt;館\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp style=\"margin-left:0.0px;\"\u003E💡參觀＜修學講堂＞及＜演講廳＞\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp style=\"margin-left:0.0px;\"\u003E💡悅滿軒午膳（太平洋吞拿澳洲肉眼扒及紐西蘭羊膝無得輸）😚\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp style=\"margin-left:0.0px;\"\u003E💡到上區翠雅山房 boutique hotel（共89間房）的&lt;琴\u002F棋\u002F詩\u002F書\u002F畫&gt; 五座樓去查房😎\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp style=\"margin-left:0.0px;\"\u003E💡在中區文青打卡熱點Coffee Flow，嘆杯手沖咖啡\u002F冷萃咖啡配自家製抹茶芝士蛋糕☕🍰\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp style=\"margin-left:0.0px;\"\u003E為參觀1895清朝関廠\u002F赴南非豬仔館\u002F檢疫中心\u002F監獄\u002F精神病院\u002F麻瘋病康復院\u002F長者療養院\u002F饒宗頤文化館劃上完滿的句號👏\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp style=\"margin-left:0.0px;\"\u003E日期：2022年10月29日（星期六）\u003Cbr\u003E集合時間：上午10:15\u003Cbr\u003E集合地點：九龍美孚青山道800號饒宗頤文化館入口\u003Cbr\u003E費用：$20（全數捐助饒館），午餐及下午茶自費\u003Cbr\u003E名額：20人\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp style=\"margin-left:0.0px;\"\u003EPowered by Empower\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Ca href=\"www.Empower.hk\"\u003Ewww.Empower.hk\u003C\u002Fa\u003E\u003Cbr\u003EFacebook.com\u002FEmpower.hk\u003Cbr\u003EYouTube.com\u002FEmpowerhk\u003C\u002Fp\u003E","JaoTsung-221029","2023-10-18T12:23:12.660Z",{"data":288},[289],{"id":14,"attributes":290},{"name":16,"slug":17,"description":8,"createdAt":18,"updatedAt":18},{"data":292},{"id":293,"attributes":294},27,{"name":295,"alternativeText":8,"caption":8,"width":88,"height":296,"formats":297,"hash":323,"ext":226,"mime":37,"size":324,"url":325,"previewUrl":8,"provider":66,"provider_metadata":8,"createdAt":326,"updatedAt":326},"IMG_0588.jpg",1250,{"large":298,"small":304,"medium":310,"thumbnail":316},{"ext":226,"url":299,"hash":300,"mime":37,"name":301,"path":8,"size":302,"width":40,"height":303},"https:\u002F\u002Fempowerhk.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com\u002Flarge_IMG_0588_1afe5eb926.jpg","large_IMG_0588_1afe5eb926","large_IMG_0588.jpg",129.26,521,{"ext":226,"url":305,"hash":306,"mime":37,"name":307,"path":8,"size":308,"width":47,"height":309},"https:\u002F\u002Fempowerhk.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com\u002Fsmall_IMG_0588_1afe5eb926.jpg","small_IMG_0588_1afe5eb926","small_IMG_0588.jpg",43.27,260,{"ext":226,"url":311,"hash":312,"mime":37,"name":313,"path":8,"size":314,"width":54,"height":315},"https:\u002F\u002Fempowerhk.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com\u002Fmedium_IMG_0588_1afe5eb926.jpg","medium_IMG_0588_1afe5eb926","medium_IMG_0588.jpg",82.34,391,{"ext":226,"url":317,"hash":318,"mime":37,"name":319,"path":8,"size":320,"width":321,"height":322},"https:\u002F\u002Fempowerhk.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com\u002Fthumbnail_IMG_0588_1afe5eb926.jpg","thumbnail_IMG_0588_1afe5eb926","thumbnail_IMG_0588.jpg",11.26,245,127,"IMG_0588_1afe5eb926",457.65,"https:\u002F\u002Fempowerhk.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com\u002FIMG_0588_1afe5eb926.jpg","2023-10-18T12:22:05.593Z",{"id":328,"attributes":329},181,{"start_date":330,"title":331,"content":332,"excerpt":8,"slug":333,"end_date":330,"tags":8,"createdAt":334,"updatedAt":334,"event_categories":335,"image":339},"2022-10-02","敦煌 — 千載情緣的故事","\u003Cp style=\"margin-left:0.0px;\"\u003EEmpower文化導賞團回來了！🥳\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp style=\"margin-left:0.0px;\"\u003E2018年「數碼敦煌 — 天上人間的故事」導賞團大受歡迎，Empower再次榮幸邀得熟諳敦煌歷史與文化的⭐星級導賞員Rosa Chiu，帶領我們遊走「敦煌 — 千載情緣的故事」，透過藝術科技及多媒體展示，深度欣賞敦煌出土文物、石窟壁畫、臨摹絹畫及複製榆林窟第25窟，感受敦煌世界中尊天、敬地、愛人的豐富情感❤️。\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp style=\"margin-left:0.0px;\"\u003E日期：2022年10月2日(星期日)&nbsp;\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp style=\"margin-left:0.0px;\"\u003E集合時間：上午10:10&nbsp;\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp style=\"margin-left:0.0px;\"\u003E集合地點：新界沙田文林路1號香港文化博物館大堂\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp style=\"margin-left:0.0px;\"\u003E門券：$10 (持博物館通行證免費入場）\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp style=\"margin-left:0.0px;\"\u003E名額：10人\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp style=\"margin-left:0.0px;\"\u003E導賞時間：2-2.5小時\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E午膳時間：12:45-14:00 (自費用膳)\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003EPowered by Empower\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Ca href=\"www.Empower.hk\"\u003Ewww.Empower.hk\u003C\u002Fa\u003E\u003Cbr\u003EFacebook.com\u002FEmpower.hk\u003Cbr\u003EYouTube.com\u002FEmpowerhk\u003C\u002Fp\u003E","Dunhuang-221002","2023-10-18T12:20:22.801Z",{"data":336},[337],{"id":14,"attributes":338},{"name":16,"slug":17,"description":8,"createdAt":18,"updatedAt":18},{"data":340},{"id":341,"attributes":342},26,{"name":343,"alternativeText":8,"caption":8,"width":88,"height":296,"formats":344,"hash":365,"ext":226,"mime":37,"size":366,"url":367,"previewUrl":8,"provider":66,"provider_metadata":8,"createdAt":368,"updatedAt":368},"IMG_0585.jpg",{"large":345,"small":350,"medium":355,"thumbnail":360},{"ext":226,"url":346,"hash":347,"mime":37,"name":348,"path":8,"size":349,"width":40,"height":303},"https:\u002F\u002Fempowerhk.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com\u002Flarge_IMG_0585_2bd27431d3.jpg","large_IMG_0585_2bd27431d3","large_IMG_0585.jpg",109.95,{"ext":226,"url":351,"hash":352,"mime":37,"name":353,"path":8,"size":354,"width":47,"height":309},"https:\u002F\u002Fempowerhk.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com\u002Fsmall_IMG_0585_2bd27431d3.jpg","small_IMG_0585_2bd27431d3","small_IMG_0585.jpg",36.76,{"ext":226,"url":356,"hash":357,"mime":37,"name":358,"path":8,"size":359,"width":54,"height":315},"https:\u002F\u002Fempowerhk.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com\u002Fmedium_IMG_0585_2bd27431d3.jpg","medium_IMG_0585_2bd27431d3","medium_IMG_0585.jpg",69.47,{"ext":226,"url":361,"hash":362,"mime":37,"name":363,"path":8,"size":364,"width":321,"height":322},"https:\u002F\u002Fempowerhk.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com\u002Fthumbnail_IMG_0585_2bd27431d3.jpg","thumbnail_IMG_0585_2bd27431d3","thumbnail_IMG_0585.jpg",10.04,"IMG_0585_2bd27431d3",386.96,"https:\u002F\u002Fempowerhk.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com\u002FIMG_0585_2bd27431d3.jpg","2023-10-18T12:19:26.921Z",{"id":370,"attributes":371},163,{"start_date":372,"title":373,"content":374,"excerpt":375,"slug":376,"end_date":8,"tags":377,"createdAt":378,"updatedAt":378,"event_categories":379,"image":383},"2021-11-17","生命密碼再探","\n\n❤️ 認識自己的性格特質，更瞭解自己，更瞭解他人\u003Cbr\u003E\n❤️ 命運數的組合？命運數以外的數字？\u003Cbr\u003E\n❤️ 如何補足自己性格的不足？\n\n日期：2021年11月27日（星期六）\u003Cbr\u003E\n時間：上午11:30-13:00\u003Cbr\u003E\n地點：旺角家樂坊15樓安利體驗館會議室C\u003Cbr\u003E\n費用 : $50\u003Cbr\u003E\n報名方式：請inbox訊息給我們報名及索取付款詳情","","discover-numerology-2","生命密碼,性格分析","2021-11-27T00:00:00.000Z",{"data":380},[381],{"id":14,"attributes":382},{"name":16,"slug":17,"description":8,"createdAt":18,"updatedAt":18},{"data":8},{"id":385,"attributes":386},149,{"start_date":387,"title":388,"content":389,"excerpt":375,"slug":390,"end_date":8,"tags":391,"createdAt":392,"updatedAt":392,"event_categories":393,"image":397},"2021-10-14","生命密碼初探","\n\n❤️ 認識自己的性格特質\u003Cbr\u003E\n❤️ 更瞭解自己，更瞭解他人\u003Cbr\u003E\n❤️ 增進有效溝通\n\n日期：2021年10月14日（星期四，假期）\u003Cbr\u003E\n時間：下午2:00-3:15\u003Cbr\u003E\n地點：旺角家樂坊15樓安利體驗館會議室B\u003Cbr\u003E\n費用 : $50\u003Cbr\u003E\n報名優惠：以優惠價$80一併報名當天3:30-4:45的血型飲食法\u003Cbr\u003E\n報名方式：請inbox訊息給我們報名及索取付款詳情","discovering-numerology","生命密碼,自我探索","2021-10-14T00:00:00.000Z",{"data":394},[395],{"id":14,"attributes":396},{"name":16,"slug":17,"description":8,"createdAt":18,"updatedAt":18},{"data":8},{"id":399,"attributes":400},93,{"start_date":401,"title":402,"content":403,"excerpt":375,"slug":404,"end_date":8,"tags":405,"createdAt":406,"updatedAt":406,"event_categories":407,"image":411},"2019-05-18","愛爾蘭咖啡(Irish Coffee) 舌尖上的愛","\n\n有人說：\n「愛爾蘭咖啡是以咖啡為名的雞尾酒，是最美麗卻最真實的謊言。」\n\n香醇的愛爾蘭威士忌，以其獨特的果香襯托著香濃的咖啡，再配以杯邊香滑的忌廉，三種截然不同的味道，碰撞出難以言喻的感覺。令人心醉，又令人一次一次昏昏欲睡。\n\n源於酒吧的愛爾蘭咖啡，背後隱藏牽動人心的愛情故事。\nEmpower 是次邀得著名咖啡師 Dr May Man 親自教授我們如何調配純正的愛爾蘭咖啡，讓我們陶醉於其醇香的同時，真切感受背後純正的愛","irish-coffee","愛爾蘭咖啡，咖啡工作坊","2019-05-18T00:00:00.000Z",{"data":408},[409],{"id":14,"attributes":410},{"name":16,"slug":17,"description":8,"createdAt":18,"updatedAt":18},{"data":8},{"id":413,"attributes":414},64,{"start_date":415,"title":416,"content":417,"excerpt":375,"slug":418,"end_date":8,"tags":419,"createdAt":420,"updatedAt":420,"event_categories":421,"image":425},"2018-10-14","「數碼敦煌—天上人間的故事","\n\n此乃香港文化博物館本年度的重點展覽，展品逾100件，包括首次在香港展出、建於西魏時期而極具代表性的莫高窟285窟，按1:1比例複製，重現洞內的壁畫和塑像，還有以數碼技術展現的莫高窟61窟的五代時期大型壁畫《五臺山圖》，以及都督夫人禮佛圖、勞度叉鬥聖變、彌勒下生經變、各國王子聽法圖等；亦有各時代的精美飛天、藻井圖案，全方位展現敦煌的歷史、文化與藝術。\n\nEmpower 榮幸邀得深諳敦煌歷史文化的李婉賢女士(Rosa)任嘉賓導賞，帶領一眾 Empower 友好深入認識敦煌，細味佛國世界與平凡眾生的故事。\n\n日期：2018年10月14日(星期日)\u003Cbr\u003E\n時間：上午10時 (博物館於上午10時開館)\u003Cbr\u003E\n地點：新界沙田文林路1號香港文化博物館大堂\u003Cbr\u003E\n門券：$10 (持博物館通行證免費入場)\u003Cbr\u003E\n名額：35人\u003Cbr\u003E\n午膳時間：12:45-14:00 (自費用膳)\u003Cbr\u003E\n鼓勵大家留下一起午膳，互相交流","cultural1810","數碼敦煌","2018-10-14T00:00:00.000Z",{"data":422},[423],{"id":14,"attributes":424},{"name":16,"slug":17,"description":8,"createdAt":18,"updatedAt":18},{"data":8},{"pagination":427},{"page":428,"pageSize":429,"pageCount":14,"total":293},1,12],"uses":{"dependencies":["http://127.0.0.1:1337/api/events?sort=start_date%3Adesc&populate[author]=true&populate[event_categories]=true&populate[image]=true&pagination[page]=1&pagination[pageSize]=12&filters[event_categories][slug]=cultural"],"params":["page","category"]}}]}